
 When selling near, issue Trigger to buy Stop-limit when underlying stock price gets too close to Strike Price


 When selling far with high delta, its like buying a stock. You would do this in a Bear market but if the stock pulls ahead you will be in a loss.
   1. Thus we need SL and TP
   2. Place Take-Profit and Stop-Loss

 Both of the above can be done on Power Etrade

 What cannot be done is both simultaneously. Saying Sale either if underlying >= threshold OR SL/TP bracket limits are hit


